### All seasons
GET http://localhost:8080/api/seasons

### Season 1
GET http://localhost:8080/api/seasons/1

### All divisions
GET http://localhost:8080/api/seasons/1/divisions

### All teams in season 1
GET http://localhost:8080/api/seasons/1/teams

### Divisions of season 1
GET http://localhost:8080/api/seasons/1/divisions

### Teams of season 1 in Division 1
GET http://localhost:8080/api/seasons/1/teams?divisionId=1

### Teams of season 1 in Division 2
GET http://localhost:8080/api/seasons/1/teams?divisionId=2

### Unknown season, expect 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/seasons/999